{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/1d/5f/14491_crt_5j15h.jpg?r=1474354496","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/1d/5f/14491_crt_5j15h.jpg?r=1474354496","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/1d/5f/14491_crt_5j15h.jpg?r=1474354496","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/1d/5f/14491_crt_5j15h.jpg?r=1474354496"},"name":"さくらももこ","summary":"主角，在学校担任小动物值日生；个性喜欢无理取闹、幼稚任性、爱和姐姐争吵、平时爱看《Ribbon》漫画和搞笑剧，但不爱运动、耍笨耍宝不收拾房间、对功课临急抱佛脚，爱占便宜、贪钱、贪新鲜并粗心大意，是个拥有不少小缺点的女孩。平常最喜爱和小玉玩太太游戏，遇到想学的事就半途而废，另外带给家人不少麻烦，性格兼且倔强，不听别人劝告。不过她一直为当漫画家的梦想而坚持、也曾在班上仗义执言、爱护小动物、有侦探头脑、乐观的小女孩。偶像是山口百惠与山本リンダ。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/9f/2f/4498_prsn_58Dz8.jpg?r=1451539257","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/9f/2f/4498_prsn_58Dz8.jpg?r=1451539257","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/9f/2f/4498_prsn_58Dz8.jpg?r=1451539257","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/9f/2f/4498_prsn_58Dz8.jpg?r=1451539257"},"name":"TARAKO","short_summary":"TARAKOは、日本の声優、ナレーター、女優、シンガーソングライター、脚本家、エッセイスト。群馬県太田市出身。トルバドール音楽事務所所属。","career":["producer","artist","seiyu","actor"],"id":4498,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":14491},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/99/df/44336_crt_1cF3n.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/99/df/44336_crt_1cF3n.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/99/df/44336_crt_1cF3n.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/99/df/44336_crt_1cF3n.jpg"},"name":"さくらさきこ","summary":"まる子の姉。\r\n11歳または12歳で入江小学校6年2組（アニメ初期は6年1組か）。\r\n1963年3月21日の雪が降る明け方に生まれた。A型、牡羊座。\r\n好きな食べ物はうなぎ、カツ丼、ラーメン、グラタンなど。\r\n宝物は友人からもらったネックレス。","relation":"配角","actors":[],"type":1,"id":44336}],"detail":[{"birth_mon":3,"gender":"female","birth_day":21,"birth_year":1963,"blood_type":1,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/99/df/44336_crt_1cF3n.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/99/df/44336_crt_1cF3n.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/99/df/44336_crt_1cF3n.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm